Dialogue: 3,0:20:31.17,0:20:33.59,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn梦源黑体 CN W20\fs80\blur0.4\bord8\c&H000000&\3c&HA1FFFC&\fad(200,200)\pos(204.26,478.5)}明天一起去上學吧?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:36.55,0:20:41.14,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn梦源黑体 CN W20\fs80\blur0.4\bord8\c&H000000&\3c&HA1FFFC&\fad(200,200)\pos(175.57,561.17)}不願意就算了吧\N我也可以找別人一起去
Dialogue: 3,0:20:42.89,0:20:46.02,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn梦源黑体 CN W20\fs80\blur0.4\bord8\c&H000000&\3c&HA1FFFC&\fad(200,200)\pos(178.93,420.08)}喂，別已讀不回啊
Dialogue: 3,0:20:46.81,0:20:50.98,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn梦源黑体 CN W20\fs80\blur0.4\bord8\c&H000000&\3c&H61E693&\fad(200,200)\pos(186.49,610.11)}由於發生了一些事\N我不能去那所學校上學了
Dialogue: 3,0:20:51.02,0:20:52.90,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn梦源黑体 CN W20\fs80\blur0.4\bord8\c&H000000&\3c&HA1FFFC&\fad(200,200)\pos(220.2,549.42)}什麼？能打電話嗎?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:58.03,0:21:00.45,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn梦源黑体 CN W20\fs80\blur0.4\bord8\c&H000000&\3c&H61E693&\fad(200,200)\pos(168.04,459.18)}抱歉，改天再說吧，今天太累了
Dialogue: 3,0:21:00.49,0:21:02.95,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn梦源黑体 CN W20\fs80\blur0.4\bord8\c&H000000&\3c&HA1FFFC&\fad(200,200)\pos(206.79,418.61)}幹嘛不接電話啊？
Dialogue: 3,0:21:02.99,0:21:04.45,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn梦源黑体 CN W20\fs80\blur0.4\bord8\c&H000000&\3c&HA1FFFC&\fad(200,200)\pos(211.82,411.9)}喂
